      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1000012607288206, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1000013620782116, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000011111918770, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "\nOur project is based on UN - Goal 11: Sustainability Cities & Communities,
        exploring the problem of urban sprawl and how it affects the wellbeing of
        people who have to live and deal with these developments. We specifically
        looked into the Phillippines and its capital area Metro Manila, as it is rated
        as having the worst traffic in Southeast Asia to date. The metropolitan as
        with many urban sprawl cities, focuses on car-centric infrastructure, developing
        dense 'urban heat islands' of packed roads and buildings that leave little
        to no sidewalks on many streets. This lack of walkability and unberable heat
        \ causes people to prefer driving / ride private shared cars, which itself
        loops back into the issue and worsen as time progresses. \n\n\"Off The Roads\"
        explores well researched solutions on how communities can reshape current
        developed infrastructure into more friendly walkable areas. Through a series
        of interactive experiences enhanced by the CAVE2's enviornmental and auditorial
        capabilities, players will apply 4 solutions to the scene - reflective coatings,
        shade structures, misting systems, and vertical gardens. These solutions are
        meant to show how easy these solutions can be implemented, and help advocate
        for human centered city planning as new cities become conceptualized. \n\nWitness
        the city transform around you with your efforts!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000011641407824, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'CS 427 - Creative Coding

        Spring 2026

        University of Illinois Chicago'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000010541511360, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: Off The Roads
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000013534834098, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000011468825520, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Ivan Pato

        Justin Perez

        Oday Suleiman

        Adam Heddaoui'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1000010808051194, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000010683909002, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "These interactions done by the player are case study tested effective
        ways of mitigating these 'urban heat islands,' by dispelling heat from buildings
        and cars that often hold and radiate heat back to the public.  \n\nWitness
        the city transform around you with your efforts!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55, type: 3}
